{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1427,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab4d084061f3e112a0de6e82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想给奇迹同学所在医院的\r\n孩子们送去绿风……\r\n我采来了很多果实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33f5859b0fdedd707eedede80827deb271530a305449ac8171d43837c9c3d2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3366ea0d4494386c8913a37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我带巧克力，红宝石同学带红茶\r\n的那场茶会，真是一阵美好光风。\r\n希望这样的日子还能再次到来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3944dbeacc90594032ec2a715d18a188dfe2d85344242e4db32e73103bf22c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e86085d97d931d27a7c203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弟弟有时会突然出现又飒爽地回去。\r\n虽然这光风我已经习以为常，\r\n但还是希望能多沐浴一会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ecd79f9ef8d351cf763776c1d323c3c553b5c9e9c74a29d71bcbf58a75f6e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14e10e31dc4c1ca20b7a2551",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮同学的脚风从早上开始就状态绝佳。\r\n我也被激励着，\r\n不自觉地卷起了旋风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff19eb891252372dc8ba8699e9f2b47afd3b1b56a247a0380648d5a7bdabc82c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3189969ef3553546593f11f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦了啊……\r\n作业被纯黑叼走了。要是\r\n能用小玻璃球换回来就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ee929d8b300fa767cd1a17c74c7087fccff10826465f74fbab5e9df886a7190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bde47895cabb64c267133175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢像木贼草一样硬的牙刷。\r\n这样可以让我感受着口中的新风，\r\n安然入睡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55aaecfd1a1b55cc922b2f15fd1721f63aa9c5ac0fefe2760c724253c1a782e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0acfe826e65994b59505ef7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小尾巴干劲十足地养育着孩子呢。\r\n呵呵，今年也从远处默默守护吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3159406b0fb0b978042833bce8ebfa75de3124211333fea047fd5300628c18dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f222231ebdfdfc7067cc3d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天想在新绿的山间与河鱼嬉戏，\r\n然后游向大海化作一缕滨风。\r\n训练员，您觉得怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d55fc5b59e1859dbb7fd0b5e5675ac1022f643b20137ed0e4f15c03f988a06d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65d77f97de03b4ff5483d0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这时节，山林间处处人山人海。\r\n不如我们趁此间隙，\r\n去往那清风徐拂的秘密之地吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cb07729b196100284aa48c56abe10d59dc4ef6ea7dc10fb9fe71e4b768fa66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee2000375bf261ec67138b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是雪风的气息……\r\n我们一起来祈祷森林里的大家\r\n都平安无事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4478255ec9b4eaa0f6368d646fe661ba3c09a18d0b7ffda7ca0937e076c51939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d736d44dfb7f5acdf64d7a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袋子里装满了野草莓。\r\n是直接享用，还是做成果酱呢……\r\n真纠结啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2ac36ea9dcf843a07161fa36739e9c01637827ed93abba21fda90933b7a9cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a65f62095a659ca090eb9759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，该做点心了。大家都来成为\r\n甜美熏风的俘虏吧。呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af76b29a53ae4805577052c29891afdf8e61f147ca24c3ac5a5fd6d7a11eaeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c03c88806ffa6b9f5ee91dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "随时都可以开始。\r\n现在已经吹起顺风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6e700a7e75cf988c4ef954ecaad5648ace3f07c937622486cee886acde6908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41fdb246573824e28d18e821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0cd39e8ab13a0534fe536e26ed485fd90dd86a466ae02e0d34d4f971e33f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b7d3bbf887a880f9447059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始跑吧。\r\n趁现在还能听见疾风的耳语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6576c75076b50428cf7a389ec3c1ec4e6002f3dc962e3664375f7eb9986e66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71cd98cfe11c62d4b832339",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竞赛须要做好各种准备。\r\n毕竟风是很善变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24294250b3f2bf98eba41ff70c099df2d697efe22b151dda8fbe346e441e15f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30653e6b2ac540818ed48034",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从平静到轻风，从轻风到暴风，\r\n然后总有一天，\r\n将化为席卷一切的猛烈风暴……",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ae0d0f38f3232d79960d3485c9239440791eae58742638ae1ef4c52cff26da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dc91824621a74bf2424702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉逐渐接近自己理想中的风了。\r\n我想，你一定就是那道顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6865ac391581e688e32e361d34113b93388960bc855630890e8217aea9735fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc29aada39ecf2dc5cd2797d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使遇到逆风也一定不会有事。\r\n因为现在训练员是我的顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf2148b43de6d9e3be8a855345bbf81fab3d21efeba97e031c3cf9d95a04096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef56894ab6216fa6b7a5194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起尽情跑到任何地方吧。\r\n我和你现在是同一道风了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d1c9247584ec043c22cb0e39a2965ebf64fb51b3e05bc7d0445597dab11c73a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f605a6dfdd88291b54e07bfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是海的味道……能跟平常不会遇见的\r\n风一起奔跑，也算是夏天的乐趣。\r\n必须快点去跟风打招呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0c3131d89d15a2c2795d0ada2b299658441a09a0d1d40d072e26e4fbf4f017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319a18a404df732d8f4431f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要按照食谱，还是秘制奇味，\r\n不必做出抉择，随风而为吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90480118cb4f28687fc60f0a51260fb312d19545cfdb8e45b839eee1367b310c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40e105c990a59dc272f974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "课堂学习和器械训练都想\r\n伴着惠风进行。\r\n这个愿望，能为我实现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9df682a3a41c32c6528bda6d3bda177047a8a76104955d68cf73ae6e0189f120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf699d1fb7a31b3e4342e98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伸展一下，放松身体……啪嗒。\r\n试着模仿了一下软糯糯的动作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9c782312128eb563f9ddb7872667cdfd866d6bfba2a985def181585d8bae632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d46b6a7bbb94758cce96c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闻到了秋风般浓郁的香气吗？\r\n呵呵，令人期待的茶点\r\n还需要再等一会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "309653e16a1b30f0c0bab28c3ee4a1b34e7b4daab0c3df5ee54375bdc45078f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2038211d6be3ebd62cdd4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是顺风放任自己的话，\r\n未免有些索然无味了。\r\n能否请教一下你的俄风呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3cdd55d9ddf6e544af8f9838e266d53c62aeae96da18ada804b1dde67811b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50bf7627b7c216f8bb4ddb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心和比赛都很重要。\r\n我们一起来携手掀起旋风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d0df1e6e89c6f8c8e929c8be015adda3adeaf7b0541324e3b1fd1d89c52821c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b4c79eb343d84b94813fbbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是被训练员充满感情的手风\r\n所邀请的话，不管去哪里，\r\n都请带着我前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ff98f6fc621d7e4c4e126b59019f38cb309e4595fc87323b14a41d686957b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02276e9ffd9012cdd677724e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望你这道指引我的风，\r\n能一直在我身边吹拂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6002d7b28608f0649a07ef113f3df124cbf02786e2c8d643655808a30af367e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c38a32949dc97fd86323a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两个人一起的话，\r\n一定能吹到任何地方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f0b82dbd48da53cba2a3e738440fb38dbab48e1403269d36251f0f180095921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38bb59c0600a10c1a4dc77dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你微风轻抚般的温柔，\r\n已成为了我的重要之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57c6e5d836054e136ec3b553c0d2ccf24ad6a69f7cced10b05ec64729db864a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1301c24cfe3be0bb1d8a610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝，\r\n来点甜甜甜的熏风怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1a57ac1587a06cfa4f44f982698455b624829955cd31041ab60d8e9749854d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0691186607934184d3d4ba18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是微风，只要持续吹下去……\r\n总有一天会变成风暴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "346de1229444aa3e3ef31d7aa89cd8330ae8ad8a4d5a9704cfa1158f77c1a6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441126a9e88f3ae233ab59c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一道疾风正在吹拂，\r\n几乎要超越那一天的风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6efbc2047d33b9ced02839b9e0f16211c23bafe3325811daf570989ec6af7175",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a8aec5bef8ca89a0b45f01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是也文摄辉，一起成为烈风吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f30825b0ab269c3fb84cfbca570a6e330dd2ad07543054fef6667edaf086d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30eb1da53dc10af0863b0a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了超越那一天的风，\r\n我会驰骋于原野，吹拂而过……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a8746d229c4254940ad56a013f35772987865f79090051af793914fa8eedf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ec142092e79eb5a6864970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风将变得更快、更强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "218e685b01ed33509147f01c24936428954027e09e68a491420a182d4ae4b1f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07d7398bfc6b4ceb700be2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春风定会在背后推我一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dde742a8d9e586ed43d27afa301fcc587491e8f6eba50cc0eb61d8baa8679542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d29b7951805993262c78b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风味增强了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cbfde611d37170e3a53b12f641dddc5477524681062e7af74db001c0e7f24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428ade4fb8d072c3abb97e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这调料是顺风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e98608874f91afdb30ae2d9cb35b4155c6d2fabe923e9ba5074b079d065b1df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bc0b8587677b0e187237537",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这承载着愿望的风能够传达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed9e1fbead84a8ec56350b88898cb72c55c997a7b8a9fc9aca35b88e2786f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a27f153887174796f3e7c3be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是也文摄辉。\r\n让思念随风而行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50979d672159619933da216d7bb760eb27697eae17017e95b8aa7d09128b90e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d6b24e9b3feeb4e1ea27df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该展现实力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c4368408b94cc9e1764cf3cd49c06dbc03af6847cbb66a35aacacd58017a540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2c97d67a4b15d9d8012f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我而言，有你就好。这份心情至今\r\n未曾改变。……此后，\r\n也绝不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d52c291c682a42ba6e70df80f5e80a73a9dccb7845de82372fcff9e503d77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c5a191246a57430cbc83ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c0e639b27d38636d4d3166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51fe82f1af722443a900d66f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵使前路艰险，\r\n只要有你这位同志在侧——\r\n那是何等的令人心安啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b5f348b4b37e69194978360a7fe16f21f7ca0e6342dd9e8071680cbcd4d4d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cb4db31e9fdd1b94e18289",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不仅对于船桥，对我而言也是\n无可替代、至关重要的人……。\n无论多少次，我都会亲口告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ddadfb7af7a8f5d5d036fdd30b3de2ad0851811df113a306821bcbab900fb8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1b1bded47d86777a46a3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让整个赛界都染上船桥的色彩……\n这就是我们新年的抱负。\n我们两人，定要合力达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4598a802765678efe0190435ab0e0036a182800a003171625d0e77d6e2572879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a73f6c962a5f9fd4c778621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是给您的谢礼巧克力——哈！\r\n您该不会已经收过中央那些孩子的了吧？\r\n请千万不要被她们勾走心魂哦？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57297c6285257044ea8353044425fbff9cfd81d1715c35e94db414f6d19b8f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a260967e010cdb4b584baa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "味道虽然普通……但巧克力中寄托的\n这份信赖与感谢，我是绝不会输给\n任何人的。……绝对不会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded4fe6326e7d3f40586824631c9e0fd6c6a57708f8eff8f74b4a9b8a65693b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94922b6554b0a9c337984f91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纸笺上的愿望似乎和我的一样呢。\r\n……既然如此，不如写上联名吧？\r\n这样感觉更容易实现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccbbaae0aa520561bed4139a391270b04fcffea96141cd736e0da49135346338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5c24bb68ca339cd76b2e2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糖果的准备已经万无一失了。中央那些\r\n“不给糖就捣蛋”之类的花招，\r\n我都会一一化解给您看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d5a40c924ebdc7cca8fdb91fb7a63475bb6478befb4c28d994b73fcf05e391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f414ac2565763dde7a5e229f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去逛圣诞集市的时候，父亲和母亲的\r\n钱包似乎就会管不住……\r\n我必须得替他们好好管理才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a437371b33d0357f21471d4699803dc12af40c27ee8af07796cec18f1fab6dc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c814fcb9c4a536cb09a4806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说圣诞会的准备工作，在我们要\r\n抵达的时候就能结束了哦。\r\n来吧来吧，我们出发，回船桥去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c892e801e082567508837fed58e0a0d33fa12329764256d80820bec1e7e6758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7b9a04467d38b8a2c5d2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d451f46b33a02f60d5453e3ae20916e2eb376a38136de5b6217d57d44af927d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4792d418bffb6a9ae465d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末的伴手礼要选什么好呢？\r\n离回去的电车发车还有时间，\r\n我们多逛几家店吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f317c58d8a600efc82288508a7d34bef5b8b5446fad651c3f54e600c5f769ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79af68b34cf26a3616438c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您生日快乐。\r\n作为志同道合之人，请允许我献上\r\n祝词——……啊，太死板了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5eb7b3ff9b16cfe51d6ceca9f6e62f0e9164bf36bdf1d72b2c2dd4926c0dad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6744cce8b51e0941343c62fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回头我会送您一条庆祝生日的手帕。\r\n因为我本人也在用，使用感绝对有\r\n保证。那可是名副其实的船桥第一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4546ab225dfaf832ca7ce746882ff7dbc215400367f4c4d8072029f23939017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e44c14eea751e685db1852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日，您一直帮我\r\n记着呢……这份船桥名点\r\n大礼包，我会心怀感激地享用的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36f63faebe3a9456135d4b9e72f9ffa7f8c77b9cbcfa871f8f68f75ea40fc96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0179fab01f0c17cc59e989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日想要的东西，是吗？\r\n那么……我想去兜风。\r\n想和同志一起，巡视我深爱的故乡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5bb5ba2dbec9f2dbd57bdf7a8787c5e88ef82264d1458808cdbdd65c0287beb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59260da2bfd8eea0096c60b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了呢。\r\n为了不失礼数，\r\n请务必仔细阅读。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fbee594b38a05ba06eed97cc89c1841b73f3219f11fdda376169a39e6adc625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd4fbba0725ad31ef43cfe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物寄到了哦。\r\n我这边也有……是从船桥寄来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b0fb5f512f128d184e39a663eb38bed37048105c1e1072f95e26e15312c716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d586fd5a3c9e8b47f59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成。\r\n看来连中央也认可了这份功绩呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ceab6207f81ef34aca966826326a6cfe4be92c1710553708126c1f210319f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6cb05e6de8320a84494183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动快要开始了吗？\r\n中央的庆典究竟有何等规模……\r\n我必须亲眼确认一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab49b858de137baf5a06771ff460bc2047c7c1d67b37828b9e578a0b50e33ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95967d152c33cf1def7f817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中呢。\r\n待会儿我们去侦察一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ebbd1b35209e3a7dfa73daab61c1b23c41421db3879f48e28806bd0419cb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a77385cd527dd35e09561c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不争气……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5d15d2948e9e163c4abf34e7d3aa43bc2ee1ce2e883455d566c215fe71f96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbe2773ca9233cb8ca20f469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了……\r\n该用日式点心来庆祝呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "808da0be2d0bbccb1583621a3175097bb1e43893c3abd7358fa7cfc2d1d8c250",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c275f106d1f359e045bbd4eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于时尚，说实话我并不太懂……。\r\n考虑到要去海滩，功能性强、\r\n方便活动的衣服才是首选吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8081d47499ad75f2f5775e89271e4d058d67a037e8643a28377f075e05b60cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0631f8de65a2776ba87911d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前，每次弄得满身是沙回家，\r\n都会被家里人苦笑迎接。当然\r\n现在的话……顶多只会粘上一点点啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f9c838c1e0e4b65cef454b2b02706aba5f42113eaba059e2991cb9f40afb53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9321c72b1ac048516d9ffbdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹似乎正在为升学的事情烦恼，\r\n却固执地一直说着『没问题』……\r\n明明可以多依赖我一下的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef086379ac5ee293fe281e657e1d307109eb7a06492913974819e65d5f119429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a42ee4088e92cb255d3c679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手也相当了得……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33bdb322ff12300fa95e5297cee84997fe671cfb20f179072cd392b3b768a0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8af2d2bece4abf18715bc3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所应当的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1768d374b56b269e239f18e45566cd0112aa08c6ae7bbcd5d928405723d6670b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4c5b97e95f8e2a6bcf07c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不争气……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5d15d2948e9e163c4abf34e7d3aa43bc2ee1ce2e883455d566c215fe71f96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab57204d3a122fd15bdf57e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手也相当了得……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33bdb322ff12300fa95e5297cee84997fe671cfb20f179072cd392b3b768a0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1f091354407137d53ddb08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd54b5d65ed7ad95de265a239cd7e0357feca6ed137778f4af2090df7519eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d963c5852fc3519916c77362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2e333d416b39f54ab43d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c4e15556edacd3aa6f9822d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要训练吗？\r\n我等候多时了。\r\n随时可以开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4a7566133cb840f50587927b74553e243297f3ae320944e233f1814b0d544d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee3500c9300a40ff0551cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中央的历史底蕴深厚……但是，\r\n船桥也绝不逊色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9183868fac4955925b20e6fc60259ec36ade021008f84f510155139cef0732c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "110001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
